# The DI nodeset is fetched, not checked in: it is ~1 MB of content the OPC
# Foundation already publishes under a stable, versioned URL (see
# commonNodesetSource in ../spec.json), and a copy here could drift from the
# NODESET_VERSION the rest of the pipeline translates.
#
# Phase 1 of adding this specification is deciding what actually lands here: the
# whole nodeset, or a generated subset in the style of
# tools/make_ns0_subset.py. Until then no rule in this spec has a shape, so the
# runner skips it and nothing needs this file to exist.
*.NodeSet2.xml
